		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Cerulean-skinned maiden with a third eye in her brow and a snake-headed tail. Embody desire and rejection.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +4 (1d8) and 2 claw +4 (1d6) or 1 wilting kiss, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the form of a humanoid, typically a subject of desire or lust.</p><p></p><p><strong>Telepathy</strong>. Can secretly know lusts and desires of all mortals within near.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wilting Kiss</strong>. Kiss a helpless or willing target. WIS 15+ or take 1d4 CHA damage and become unwilling to resist daemon's kiss for 1d4 rounds, servile and passive at 0 CHA.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
